   "rationale": "问题成立，已作为 F1 列出：story.9 未交代南卡罗来纳分裂票针对的是签署格式，而不是宪法本身。",
   "evidence": [
    {
     "id": "F-E25",
     "quote": "disliked the equivocal form of signing, and on that account voted in the negative"
    }
